  "id": "desyrel",
  "term": "Desyrel",
  "definition": "Desyrel is a brand name for trazodone hydrochloride, a medication with antidepressant and sedating effects. It appears to work mainly by reducing serotonin reuptake in the brain, which increases serotonin activity, and its calming effects are also linked to alpha-adrenergic and mild histamine H1 blocking actions.",
